---
import Container from "../base/Container.astro";
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
---

<section class="py-24 bg-cream relative overflow-hidden" id="qrcode-guestbook">
  <!-- Soft background element -->
  <div
    class="absolute left-0 top-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-brand-200/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Premium Visual Backdrop (4:3) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative animate-fade-in">
        <div
          class="relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-elevated border border-brand-200/40 bg-brand-950 aspect-[4/3] group"
        >
          <!-- Dark Elegant overlay -->
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-950/60 via-transparent to-brand-950/20 z-10"
          >
          </div>

          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?q=80&w=800"
            alt="Meja Penerima Tamu Resepsi dengan Buku Tamu Digital"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover filter sepia-[15%] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out z-0"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <!-- Float Badge: Real-time Indicator -->
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-20 flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-champagne/30 shadow-md"
          >
            <span class="flex w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-success animate-ping"
            ></span>
            <span
              class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-brand-950 font-sans"
              >Sistem Resepsi Hari-H Aktif</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Decorative Card Floating next to it -->
        <div
          class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 bg-brand-950 text-cream p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-elevated border border-brand-850 z-20 animate-float-slow max-w-[220px]"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold shrink-0"
          >
            <Icon name="qr-code" size={20} />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4
              class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-soft-gold font-bold"
            >
              Teknologi Hari-H
            </h4>
            <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-cream/90 leading-tight mt-0.5">
              Scan QR Tamu Langsung di Meja Penerima
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Strategic Copy -->
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-8 animate-fade-in"
        style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"
      >
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-200/60 bg-surface/50 backdrop-blur-md"
        >
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-soft-gold"></span>
          <span
            class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-brand-700"
            >Digital Check-In Suite</span
          >
        </div>

        <h2
          class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-950 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight"
        >
          Aplikasi Buku Tamu Digital & <span
            class="italic font-normal text-soft-gold">Scan QR Code</span
          > Tamu Resepsi.
        </h2>

        <p
          class="text-text-secondary text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-[500px]"
        >
          Hilangkan antrean panjang di meja resepsi. Undangan pernikahan dengan
          QR Code otomatis terintegrasi dengan sistem manajemen kehadiran tamu
          undangan terpusat untuk kelancaran hari pernikahan Anda.
        </p>

        <!-- Dynamic Grid of Benefits -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B59A73]/15 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold"
            >
              <Icon name="zap" size={14} />
            </div>
            <h3
              class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
            >
              Scan Instan 0.5 Detik
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
            >
              Tamu cukup menunjukkan kode QR unik di layar ponsel mereka untuk
              dipindai oleh petugas WO menggunakan perangkat tablet/smartphone
              apa pun secara praktis.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B59A73]/15 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold"
            >
              <Icon name="shield-check" size={14} />
            </div>
            <h3
              class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
            >
              Proteksi Tamu Gelap
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
            >
              Sistem otomatis mencocokkan kode QR dengan basis data tamu Anda,
              mendeteksi tamu tidak sah secara presisi untuk menjaga keamanan
              resepsi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B59A73]/15 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold"
            >
              <Icon name="clipboard-list" size={14} />
            </div>
            <h3
              class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
            >
              Buku Tamu Real-time
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
            >
              Daftar tamu yang telah hadir langsung tercatat secara rapi di
              database digital. Anda dapat memantau kuota kehadiran katering
              secara langsung.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B59A73]/15 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold"
            >
              <Icon name="copy" size={14} />
            </div>
            <h3
              class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
            >
              Ekspor Data Sekali Klik
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
            >
              Setelah acara selesai, ekspor buku tamu digital Anda ke format
              Microsoft Excel / CSV hanya dengan sekali ketuk dari dashboard
              admin.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
